## Shared filesystem once per session check

- Tests whether Guide shares your filesystem directly.
- If shared:
  - Guide can read files directly instead of asking you to send them
  - Supports your use of relative paths and environment variables
- If not shared:
  - no change, Guide must ask you to send files

